---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Btn from "../components/Btn.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Account Sténtor – Sténtor"
  description="Area cliente Sténtor per licenze, download e attivazioni."
  active={null}
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-[760px] mb-10">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-red-500 mb-4">Area cliente</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-[72px] tracking-[-0.06em] leading-[0.98] font-semibold mb-5">Account Sténtor.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-2 leading-[1.55] max-w-[720px]">
        Questa area ospiterà licenze, download, scadenze e postazioni attivate per teatri, compagnie, festival, scuole e istituzioni.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.72fr] gap-5 items-start">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-surface p-6 md:p-7">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-hairline pb-5 mb-5">
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-text-4 mb-2">Licenza</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">Nessuna licenza collegata</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-hairline px-3 py-1 text-xs text-text-3">in preparazione</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-3 leading-[1.6] mb-6">
          Dopo l’attivazione, qui compariranno piano, scadenza, numero di postazioni e link per scaricare Sténtor Pro.
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-elevated p-4">
            <p class="text-text-4 text-xs mb-1">Piano</p>
            <p class="font-medium">—</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-elevated p-4">
            <p class="text-text-4 text-xs mb-1">Scadenza</p>
            <p class="font-medium">—</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-elevated p-4">
            <p class="text-text-4 text-xs mb-1">Postazioni</p>
            <p class="font-medium">—</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <Btn href="/richiedi-prova" variant="primary" size="md">Richiedi accesso Pro</Btn>
      </article>

      <aside class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-sunken p-6 md:p-7">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] mb-3">Hai già ricevuto una licenza?</h2>
        <p class="text-text-3 leading-[1.6] mb-6">
          Accedi con Google, Microsoft o link email. Nella versione definitiva l’account verrà associato alla licenza assegnata alla tua organizzazione.
        </p>
        <Btn href="/accesso" variant="ghost" size="md">Accedi</Btn>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
